    "updated_at": "2024-12-27T14:46:56Z",
    "body": "Currently, Blink and WebKit applies `overflow: auto` even if `overflow: visible`.\r\n\r\nWebKit: https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/d7ba780797fcdce60dc5c981fb9f233b93e360b1/Source/WebCore/style/StyleAdjuster.cpp#L564 (Bug - https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=276294)\r\n\r\nBlink: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/css/resolver/style_adjuster.cc;l=561?q=Style_Adjuster.cc\r\n\r\nIt leads to failing sub-test in `html/rendering/non-replaced-elements/form-controls/resets.html`.\r\n\r\nWhile Gecko passes it.",
