    "created_at": "2025-01-17T12:59:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-17T12:59:47Z",
    "body": "I think the preferred way to do this is to override the used style instead of computed style. So `getComputedStyle` should return `visible` but the used style is `auto`.\r\n\r\nGecko renders as if `auto`. https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/13402",
